  "description": "Compile-time test data builders for .NET via Roslyn source generators. Add [AutoBuilder] to a partial class with a public parameterless constructor and settable properties — AutoTestData generates a fluent {Type}Builder with sensible, unique fake values (strings, numbers, Guids, dates, enums) for every property, plus With{Property}() overrides and a Build() method. Zero reflection, zero runtime overhead, AOT-safe. A drop-in AutoFixture/Bogus alternative for object creation in unit tests — no attributes on every field, no runtime type inspection.",
